    {
      "words": "be sure to do sth., be sure of doing sth.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "be sure to do sth."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指别人（说话者或他人）“相信”，而不是作为句子主语的人或事“相信”。如改写成 that 从句，主句的主语和从句的主语不同。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He is sure to succeed. (= I am sure that he will succeed.) 他一定会成功。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "be sure of doing sth."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指句子的主语“相信”，主语必定是人。如改写成 that 从句，主句和从句的主语为同一人。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He is sure of winning. (= He is sure that he will win.) 他确信他（自己）一定会赢。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
